Package: geo-bypass
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ald
Depends: keenetic-entware-extras, ip-full, ipset, curl, bind-dig
Recommends: jq
Description: Selective GEO IP routing for Keenetic routers (route-based, NDM-compatible).
 Routes country IP subnets (CIDR) via ISP directly or through VPN tunnel.
 Uses ip rule + ip route (no iptables fwmark) for Keenetic NDM compatibility.
Section: net
Priority: optional
